ata-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"59\" data-end=\"320\">De Power Dynamics PDH632 is een draadloos UHF microfoonsysteem dat geschikt is voor zang, presentaties, evenementen en karaoke. Dankzij de stabiele draadloze verbinding en de meegeleverde microfoons kun je direct aan de slag voor professioneel en helder geluid.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"322\" data-end=\"348\"><strong data-start=\"322\" data-end=\"331\">Staat</strong><br data-start=\"331\" data-end=\"334\">In Nette Staat</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"350\" data-end=\"561\">⭐ <strong data-start=\"352\" data-end=\"365\">Voordelen</strong><br data-start=\"365\" data-end=\"368\">⭐ Draadloos UHF microfoonsysteem<br data-start=\"400\" data-end=\"403\">⭐ Inclusief microfoons<br data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"428\">⭐ Geschikt voor zang, presentaties en karaoke<br data-start=\"473\" data-end=\"476\">⭐ Stabiele verbinding en helder geluid<br data-start=\"514\" data-end=\"517\">⭐ Eenvoudig aan te sluiten en te gebruiken</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"563\" data-end=\"921\">📋 <strong data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"583\">Specificaties</strong><br data-start=\"583\" data-end=\"586\"><strong data-start=\"586\" data-end=\"595\">Type:</strong> UHF receiver / draadloos microfoonsysteem<br data-start=\"637\" data-end=\"640\"><strong data-start=\"640\" data-end=\"650\">Model:</strong> Power Dynamics PDH632<br data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"675\"><strong data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"694\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Connectiviteit:</strong> UHF draadloos<br data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"711\"><strong data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"726\">Microfoons:</strong> Inclusief draadloze microfoons<br data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"760\"><strong data-start=\"760\" data-end=\"772\">Gebruik:</strong> Karaoke, evenementen, zang, presentaties<br data-start=\"813\" data-end=\"816\"><strong data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"834\">Aansluitingen:</strong> Audio output<br data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"850\"><strong data-start=\"850\" data-end=\"862\">Voeding:</strong> Netstroom<br data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"875\"><strong data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"885\">Kleur:</strong> Zwart<br data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"894\"><strong data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"904\">Staat:</strong> In Nette Staat</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"1017\">📦 <strong data-start=\"926\" data-end=\"941\">Meegeleverd</strong><br data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"944\">Power Dynamics PDH632 Receiver<br data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"977\">Draadloze microfoons<br data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1000\">Voedingsadapter</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1076\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">🛡️ <strong data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1041\">Incl. Garantie</strong><br data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1044\">Incl. Garantie: 1 maand garantie</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"> </div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<div class=\"contents\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>",
